get used to somewhere,


01:32:26.323 --> 01:32:27.781
I move.


01:32:35.740 --> 01:32:37.157
Hi.


01:32:39.324 --> 01:32:42.907
-I love your flower headband.


01:32:42.990 --> 01:32:45.284
