I just feel like
my purpose here


01:44:41.449 --> 01:44:45.284
is much bigger
than just my past.


01:44:45.367 --> 01:44:48.868
That's what I'm-- I'm-- I'm--
I'm figuring out.


01:44:48.951 --> 01:44:50.993
That's what I'm chasing,
and that's what I'm--


01:44:51.784 --> 01:44:53.118
I'm fighting for.


01:44:55.951 --> 01:44:58.577
My favorite quote does come
from Audrey Hepburn.


01:44:58.660 --> 01:45:01.202
It is, "Nothing is impossible.


01:45:01.286 --> 01:45:04.161
Even the word
itself says, 'I'm possible.'"


01:45:07.493 --> 01:45:08.618
There we go.


01:45:11.996 --> 01:45:14.163
Lord,
we just thank you for this day.


01:45:14.246 --> 01:45:16.787
We thank you for this
Mother's Day, a special day.


01:45:16.871 --> 01:45:19.246
I have so much
to be grateful for.


01:45:19.329 --> 01:45:21.704
You know, just to have us
all together.


01:45:21.787 --> 01:45:23.872
I'm grateful for you
to be my mom,


01:45:23.955 --> 01:45:25.705
and I love you too much.


01:45:25.788 --> 01:45:27.913
-Too much?
-That's sweet.


01:45:27.997 --> 01:45:29.705
Casi, you wanna say something?


01:45:33.039 --> 01:45:34.664
Say, "Happy Mother's Day, Mom."


01:45:34.747 --> 01:45:38.623
-Happy Mother's Day.


01:45:38.707 --> 01:45:41.291
A lot of people look around,
and we use terms like,


01:45:41.374 --> 01:45:44.082
oh, this is, you know,
foster sister,


01:45:44.166 --> 01:45:46.957
or foster brother, or adopted,
and all that stuff,


01:45:47.040 --> 01:45:49.748
but we don't use those terms
in this house.


01:45:49.832 --> 01:45:51.583
We just use the term,
"This is my sister.


01:45:51.666 --> 01:45:52.875
This is my brother."


01:45:52.958 --> 01:45:54.875
We just welcome them
in our house.


01:45:54.958 --> 01:45:59.042
I'm just grateful that my mom
has taught me to be like that.


01:46:00.542 --> 01:46:02.625
Words can't describe
how much I love you.


01:46:02.709 --> 01:46:04.169
You've always been there for me,


01:46:04.252 --> 01:46:07.585
and you've never given up
even if I stress you out a lot.


01:46:07.668 --> 01:46:09.626
You've been there
through thick and thin,


01:46:09.710 --> 01:46:12.043
and you even came off
your vacation getaway


01:46:12.127 --> 01:46:14.335
to tend for my bad self.


01:46:14.419 --> 01:46:17.627
You are the carbo to my hydrate,
the eco to my system.


01:46:17.711 --> 01:46:20.545
I love you more than science,
and I love you more


01:46:20.628 --> 01:46:23.254
than the number of atoms
in a human body.


01:46:23.337 --> 01:46:26.503
P.S. There is about 100 trillion
atoms in the human body.


01:46:26.587 --> 01:46:27.795
-Denyshia.


01:46:27.879 --> 01:46:29.421
This is my--
this is my honors student.


01:46:30.712 --> 01:46:32.172
And I would like
to award you


01:46:32.255 --> 01:46:34.338
this award behalf of
the Adoptive


01:46:34.422 --> 01:46:36.921
-and-- and Foster Co...
-What?


01:46:37.005 --> 01:46:38.255
...Inc.


01:46:38.338 --> 01:46:41.713
Look it. How does she know
that? She is too smart.


01:46:41.796 --> 01:46:44.923
-Too smart, Denyshia.


01:46:45.007 --> 01:46:47.548
When I get older,
and I have enough money,


01:46:47.631 --> 01:46:50.631
I'm gonna buy her a house,
and a car,


01:46:50.715 --> 01:46:53.965
and then someone
to take care of her.


01:46:54.048 --> 01:46:55.465
Or, if she doesn't want that,


01:46:55.548 --> 01:46:57.840
she can come live
in my big house.


01:46:57.924 --> 01:47:00.757
Like, she can have
the west wing of the house.


01:47:00.841 --> 01:47:03.383
Every three months,
I'll send her to trips,


01:47:03.466 --> 01:47:05.757
so she can have a break,
'cause, you know,


01:47:05.841 --> 01:47:07.217
she needs breaks.


01:47:07.301 --> 01:47:10.592
And then I will just give her
everything she wants


01:47:10.675 --> 01:47:13.343
and then, like, care for her
like she did for me.


01:47:14.593 --> 01:47:16.010
I would like to take care of her


01:47:16.093 --> 01:47:18.177
for the stuff she's been doing
for me,


01:47:18.260 --> 01:47:20.885
and I would also like to
give her her own coffee shop,


01:47:20.968 --> 01:47:22.759
'cause she loves coffee a lot.


01:47:22.843 --> 01:47:24.801
-How you know about that?


01:47:24.885 --> 01:47:27.719
I was brought up
with a lotta kids


01:47:27.802 --> 01:47:29.262
and a lotta love.


01:47:29.345 --> 01:47:32.137
My mom taught us to love
each other no matter what,


01:47:32.220 --> 01:47:33.845
and I teach my kids that now.


01:47:33.928 --> 01:47:35.803
Love your mom and your dad.


01:47:35.887 --> 01:47:37.262
They couldn't take care
of you guys.


01:47:37.345 --> 01:47:39.554
They have a problem,
but you got to love them


01:47:39.637 --> 01:47:41.929
'cause they're still your mom
and-- and your dad.


01:47:42.013 --> 01:47:44.221
You can't not like them,
say they're not your mom.


01:47:44.305 --> 01:47:45.721
They are.


01:47:45.804 --> 01:47:47.888
I'm just fillin' in for them
till they get better.


01:47:47.971 --> 01:47:49.846
Some will get better,
and some won't,


01:47:49.929 --> 01:47:52.513
but you have to have hope
that they're gonna get better.


01:48:10.016 --> 01:48:11.765
♪ Some days
I look in the mirror ♪


01:48:11.849 --> 01:48:16.267
♪ And I think
The meanest things ♪


01:48:16.350 --> 01:48:18.683
♪ Oh, the meanest things ♪


01:48:20.851 --> 01:48:23.517
♪ Some days I'm holding
My self-worth up ♪


01:48:24.435 --> 01:48:26.310
♪ By a string ♪


01:48:27.351 --> 01:48:29.767
♪ A string ♪


01:48:29.851 --> 01:48:34.060
♪ But every day that I don't
Hide myself away ♪


01:48:35.311 --> 01:48:40.728
♪ To me is a tiny victory ♪


01:48:47.229 --> 01:48:50.937
♪ Some days
Giving up on myself looks so ♪


01:48:51.021 --> 01:48:55.562
♪ So easy to do
It's so easy to do ♪


01:48:57.146 --> 01:49:01.730
♪ The struggle is slow
I'm barely moving the needle ♪


01:49:01.813 --> 01:49:04.190
♪ And the cracks may be few ♪


01:49:04.273 --> 01:49:07.023
♪ But there's light
Coming through ♪


01:49:07.106 --> 01:49:11.981
♪ And if battles
Can win a war ♪


01:49:12.064 --> 01:49:16.940
♪ I can keep picking
My sword up off the floor ♪


01:49:18.024 --> 01:49:22.107
